{"seq":2,"slug":"message-contract-patterns","title":"消息契约设计模式：Schema 演化与兼容性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-microservices/foundations/message-contract-patterns","wordCount":1360,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"消息契约设计模式-schema-演化与兼容性\">消息契约设计模式：Schema 演化与兼容性</h1><p>消息契约是服务间通信的&quot;接口定义&quot;，但与 HTTP API 不同，消息队列中的消息可能在几秒到几天后才被消费，而消费者和生产者往往独立部署。这意味着<strong>消息契约必须从第一天起就考虑演化</strong>。本文梳理 Schema 设计原则、序列化格式选择和消费者驱动契约测试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>关键点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>向后兼容（Backward）</strong></td>\n<td>新 Schema 可以读取旧数据</td>\n<td>消费者先升级、生产者后升级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>向前兼容（Forward）</strong></td>\n<td>旧 Schema 可以读取新数据</td>\n<td>生产者先升级、消费者后升级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>宽进严出（Postel&#39;s Law）</strong></td>\n<td>消费者忽略未知字段，生产者严格发布</td>\n<td>提升系统容错性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Schema Registry</strong></td>\n<td>Schema 的集中版本管理系统</td>\n<td>自动兼容性验证，ID 内嵌消息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>CDCT（消费者驱动契约测试）</strong></td>\n<td>由消费者定义格式期望，在生产者侧验证</td>\n<td>CI 阶段发现兼容性问题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么消息契约演化如此重要\">为什么消息契约演化如此重要</h2><p>在 HTTP API 场景中，服务端升级后老客户端可以继续用旧接口（保持接口不变），或者强制客户端升级。但在消息系统中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>消息队列中可能存有旧格式消息</strong>：升级后的消费者必须处理历史消息</li>\n<li><strong>消费者和生产者独立发布</strong>：不能保证同步升级</li>\n<li><strong>消费者可能有多个版本</strong>：金丝雀发布时同时运行新旧消费者</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些场景要求消息契约具备<strong>向后兼容</strong>和<strong>向前兼容</strong>的能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"schema-兼容性规则\">Schema 兼容性规则</h2><h3 id=\"兼容性类型定义\">兼容性类型定义</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兼容性类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>向后兼容（Backward）</strong></td>\n<td>新 Schema 可以读取旧数据</td>\n<td>消费者先升级，生产者后升级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>向前兼容（Forward）</strong></td>\n<td>旧 Schema 可以读取新数据</td>\n<td>生产者先升级，消费者后升级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>完全兼容（Full）</strong></td>\n<td>同时向后和向前兼容</td>\n<td>最安全，要求最严格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>无兼容性（None）</strong></td>\n<td>不保证任何兼容</td>\n<td>破坏性变更，需版本号区分</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"安全变更与危险变更\">安全变更与危险变更</h3><p><strong>允许的安全变更（不破坏兼容性）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// v1 Schema（原始）&#10;{&#10;  &quot;orderId&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,&#10;  &quot;customerId&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,&#10;  &quot;totalAmount&quot;: &quot;number&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// v2 Schema（向后兼容的演化）&#10;{&#10;  &quot;orderId&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,&#10;  &quot;customerId&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,&#10;  &quot;totalAmount&quot;: &quot;number&quot;,&#10;  &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,    // 新增字段，有默认值&#10;  &quot;discount&quot;: &quot;number&quot;     // 新增可选字段&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// v1 Schema（原始）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"orderId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"customerId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"totalAmount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"number\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// v2 Schema（向后兼容的演化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"orderId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"customerId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"totalAmount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"number\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 新增字段，有默认值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"discount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"number\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     // 新增可选字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>危险变更（破坏兼容性）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// v3 Schema（破坏性变更 - 不应这样做）&#10;{&#10;  &quot;order_id&quot;: &quot;string&quot;, // 字段重命名 - 破坏性&#10;  &quot;customer_id&quot;: &quot;string&quot;, // 字段重命名 - 破坏性&#10;  &quot;amount&quot;: &quot;number&quot; // 字段重命名 - 破坏性&#10;  // totalAmount 字段删除 - 向前不兼容&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// v3 Schema（破坏性变更 - 不应这样做）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 字段重命名 - 破坏性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"customer_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 字段重命名 - 破坏性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"number\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 字段重命名 - 破坏性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // totalAmount 字段删除 - 向前不兼容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"宽进严出原则-postel-s-law-的消息应用\">宽进严出原则（Postel&#39;s Law 的消息应用）</h3><p>在消息处理中应遵循<strong>宽进严出</strong>原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>消费者要宽容</strong>：遇到不认识的字段忽略，遇到缺失字段使用默认值</li>\n<li><strong>生产者要严格</strong>：只发布自己明确定义的字段</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这要求在序列化框架配置上做出对应选择：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# Python + pydantic 示例：宽容消费者配置&#10;from pydantic import BaseModel, Extra&#10;&#10;class OrderPlacedEvent(BaseModel):&#10;    order_id: str&#10;    customer_id: str&#10;    total_amount: float&#10;    currency: str = &quot;CNY&quot;  # 有默认值，向后兼容&#10;&#10;    class Config:&#10;        extra = Extra.ignore  # 忽略未知字段（宽进）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Python + pydantic 示例：宽容消费者配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pydantic </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BaseModel, Extra</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderPlacedEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">BaseModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    order_id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    customer_id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total_amount: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    currency: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"CNY\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 有默认值，向后兼容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        extra </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Extra.ignore  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 忽略未知字段（宽进）</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// Java + Jackson 示例：宽容消费者配置&#10;@JsonIgnoreProperties(ignoreUnknown = true)  // 忽略未知字段&#10;public class OrderPlacedEvent {&#10;    private String orderId;&#10;    private String customerId;&#10;    private BigDecimal totalAmount;&#10;    private String currency = &quot;CNY&quot;;  // 默认值&#10;    // getters/setters...&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Java + Jackson 示例：宽容消费者配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JsonIgnoreProperties</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ignoreUnknown</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 忽略未知字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderPlacedEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> String orderId;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> String customerId;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BigDecimal totalAmount;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> String currency </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"CNY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 默认值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // getters/setters...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"序列化格式选择\">序列化格式选择</h2><h3 id=\"主流格式对比\">主流格式对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>JSON</strong></td>\n<td>人类可读，调试方便，无需工具</td>\n<td>体积大，无内置 Schema 验证</td>\n<td>调试环境，低吞吐量场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Apache Avro</strong></td>\n<td>Schema 内嵌或注册，压缩好，强类型</td>\n<td>二进制，需 Schema 文件读取</td>\n<td>Kafka 高吞吐，Schema 注册</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Protocol Buffers</strong></td>\n<td>快速，强类型，跨语言</td>\n<td>Schema 强依赖，调试需工具</td>\n<td>gRPC，高性能消息传递</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Apache Thrift</strong></td>\n<td>多语言，内置 RPC</td>\n<td>社区活跃度低</td>\n<td>遗留系统兼容</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"avro-schema-示例\">Avro Schema 示例</h3><p>Avro 是 Kafka 生态中最常用的序列化格式，支持 Schema Registry：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;record&quot;,&#10;  &quot;namespace&quot;: &quot;com.example.orders&quot;,&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;OrderPlaced&quot;,&#10;  &quot;fields&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;orderId&quot;,&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;customerId&quot;,&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;totalAmount&quot;,&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;double&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;currency&quot;,&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: [&quot;null&quot;, &quot;string&quot;],&#10;      &quot;default&quot;: null&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;placedAt&quot;,&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;type&quot;: &quot;long&quot;,&#10;        &quot;logicalType&quot;: &quot;timestamp-millis&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"record\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"namespace\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"com.example.orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"OrderPlaced\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"fields\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orderId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"customerId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"totalAmount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"double\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"null\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"placedAt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"long\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"logicalType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"timestamp-millis\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Avro 的 union 类型 <code>[&quot;null&quot;, &quot;string&quot;]</code> 用于表示可选字段，<code>default: null</code> 使其向后兼容——老 Schema 写的消息不含此字段，新 Schema 读时得到 null。</p>\n<h3 id=\"protobuf-schema-示例\">Protobuf Schema 示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"protobuf\" data-code=\"syntax = &quot;proto3&quot;;&#10;&#10;package com.example.orders;&#10;&#10;message OrderPlaced {&#10;  string order_id = 1;&#10;  string customer_id = 2;&#10;  double total_amount = 3;&#10;  string currency = 4;         // proto3 所有字段都是可选的&#10;  int64 placed_at_millis = 5;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>syntax = \"proto3\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>package com.example.orders;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message OrderPlaced {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string order_id = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string customer_id = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  double total_amount = 3;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string currency = 4;         // proto3 所有字段都是可选的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int64 placed_at_millis = 5;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Protobuf 的字段编号（<code>= 1</code>, <code>= 2</code>）是关键：<strong>永远不要复用已删除字段的编号</strong>，否则会导致反序列化错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"schema-registry-schema-注册中心\">Schema Registry（Schema 注册中心）</h2><p>Schema Registry 是消息契约的集中管理系统，负责：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>存储和版本化 Schema 定义</li>\n<li>在序列化/反序列化时验证兼容性</li>\n<li>通过 Schema ID 关联消息与其 Schema</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Producer&#10;    participant Registry as Schema Registry&#10;    participant Kafka&#10;    participant Consumer&#10;&#10;    Producer-&gt;&gt;Registry: 注册 Schema(或获取 ID)&#10;    Registry--&gt;&gt;Producer: Schema ID = 42&#10;    Producer-&gt;&gt;Kafka: 发布消息(含 Schema ID=42 前缀)&#10;    Consumer-&gt;&gt;Kafka: 读取消息&#10;    Consumer-&gt;&gt;Registry: 根据 Schema ID 获取 Schema&#10;    Registry--&gt;&gt;Consumer: 返回 Schema 定义&#10;    Consumer-&gt;&gt;Consumer: 反序列化消息\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Producer\n    participant Registry as Schema Registry\n    participant Kafka\n    participant Consumer\n\n    Producer-&gt;&gt;Registry: 注册 Schema(或获取 ID)\n    Registry--&gt;&gt;Producer: Schema ID = 42\n    Producer-&gt;&gt;Kafka: 发布消息(含 Schema ID=42 前缀)\n    Consumer-&gt;&gt;Kafka: 读取消息\n    Consumer-&gt;&gt;Registry: 根据 Schema ID 获取 Schema\n    Registry--&gt;&gt;Consumer: 返回 Schema 定义\n    Consumer-&gt;&gt;Consumer: 反序列化消息</pre><p><strong>Confluent Schema Registry 配置示例（Java）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"Properties props = new Properties();&#10;props.put(&quot;bootstrap.servers&quot;, &quot;kafka:9092&quot;);&#10;props.put(&quot;key.serializer&quot;, StringSerializer.class);&#10;props.put(&quot;value.serializer&quot;, KafkaAvroSerializer.class);&#10;props.put(&quot;schema.registry.url&quot;, &quot;http://schema-registry:8081&quot;);&#10;// 兼容性策略：BACKWARD（消费者先升级）&#10;// 在 Registry 中设置 subject 级别的策略&#10;&#10;KafkaProducer&lt;String, OrderPlaced&gt; producer = new KafkaProducer&lt;&gt;(props);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Properties props </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Properties</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">props.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bootstrap.servers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"kafka:9092\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">props.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"key.serializer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, StringSerializer.class);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">props.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"value.serializer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, KafkaAvroSerializer.class);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">props.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"schema.registry.url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"http://schema-registry:8081\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 兼容性策略：BACKWARD（消费者先升级）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 在 Registry 中设置 subject 级别的策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">KafkaProducer&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OrderPlaced</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> producer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> KafkaProducer&#x3C;>(props);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"消费者驱动契约测试-cdct\">消费者驱动契约测试（CDCT）</h2><p>消费者驱动契约测试（Consumer-Driven Contract Testing）是验证消息契约兼容性的重要实践，由消费者定义对生产者消息格式的期望，并在生产者侧验证。</p>\n<h3 id=\"pact-框架示例\">Pact 框架示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 消费者侧：定义契约期望（inventory-service）&#10;from pact import MessageConsumer, Provider&#10;&#10;pact = MessageConsumer(&#39;inventory-service&#39;).has_pact_with(&#10;    Provider(&#39;order-service&#39;))&#10;&#10;# 定义消费者期望的消息格式&#10;expected_event = {&#10;    &quot;orderId&quot;: &quot;order-12345&quot;,&#10;    &quot;items&quot;: [&#10;        {&quot;productId&quot;: &quot;prod-001&quot;, &quot;quantity&quot;: 2}&#10;    ]&#10;}&#10;&#10;pact.given(&quot;an order exists&quot;)&#10;    .expects_to_receive(&quot;an order placed event&quot;)&#10;    .with_content(expected_event)&#10;    .with_metadata({&quot;content-type&quot;: &quot;application/json&quot;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 消费者侧：定义契约期望（inventory-service）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pact </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MessageConsumer, Provider</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pact </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MessageConsumer(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'inventory-service'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).has_pact_with(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Provider(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order-service'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 定义消费者期望的消息格式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">expected_event </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"orderId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order-12345\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"items\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"productId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"prod-001\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"quantity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pact.given(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"an order exists\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .expects_to_receive(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"an order placed event\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .with_content(expected_event)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .with_metadata({</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"content-type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"application/json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 生产者侧：验证契约（order-service CI 流程中运行）&#10;# 从 Pact Broker 拉取消费者定义的契约&#10;# 验证 order-service 发布的消息满足所有消费者期望\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 生产者侧：验证契约（order-service CI 流程中运行）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 从 Pact Broker 拉取消费者定义的契约</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 验证 order-service 发布的消息满足所有消费者期望</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"契约测试的价值\">契约测试的价值</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>没有契约测试</th>\n<th>有契约测试</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>消费者只能通过集成测试发现格式不兼容</td>\n<td>在 CI 阶段就发现兼容性问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产者不知道谁在消费自己的消息</td>\n<td>生产者可见所有消费者的期望</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>破坏性变更往往在生产环境才被发现</td>\n<td>破坏性变更被门控阻止合并</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"版本策略-何时创建新版本\">版本策略：何时创建新版本</h2><p>推荐的版本策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"向后兼容的变更（新增可选字段）&#10;  → 直接修改 Schema，保持同一版本&#10;  → 更新 Schema Registry&#10;&#10;向前不兼容的变更（删除字段、修改类型）&#10;  → 创建新的事件类型（如 order.placed.v2）&#10;  → 并行运行 v1 和 v2 一段时间&#10;  → 等待消费者完成迁移后，废弃 v1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>向后兼容的变更（新增可选字段）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 直接修改 Schema，保持同一版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 更新 Schema Registry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>向前不兼容的变更（删除字段、修改类型）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 创建新的事件类型（如 order.placed.v2）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 并行运行 v1 和 v2 一段时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 等待消费者完成迁移后，废弃 v1</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"兄弟文档参考\">兄弟文档参考</h2><p>本文聚焦 Schema 设计与演化；CloudEvents 规范中的 <code>dataschema</code> 字段如何与 Schema Registry 配合，见本章的事件类型设计文档；Kafka Schema Registry 的具体运维操作，参见第2章基础设施部分的 Schema 注册与演化文档。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>消息契约演化的核心规则：新增可选字段是安全的（向后兼容），删除或重命名字段是危险的（破坏性变更需要新版本类型）。Avro 的 union 类型 <code>[&quot;null&quot;, &quot;string&quot;]</code> 加 <code>default: null</code> 是实现向后兼容可选字段的标准做法。消费者应配置为忽略未知字段（宽进），生产者严格按 Schema 发布（严出）。消费者驱动契约测试（CDCT）将兼容性验证前移到 CI，是防止生产事故的关键工程实践。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"消息契约设计模式：Schema 演化与兼容性","id":"消息契约设计模式-schema-演化与兼容性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么消息契约演化如此重要","id":"为什么消息契约演化如此重要"},{"level":2,"text":"Schema 兼容性规则","id":"schema-兼容性规则"},{"level":3,"text":"兼容性类型定义","id":"兼容性类型定义"},{"level":3,"text":"安全变更与危险变更","id":"安全变更与危险变更"},{"level":3,"text":"宽进严出原则（Postel's Law 的消息应用）","id":"宽进严出原则-postel-s-law-的消息应用"},{"level":2,"text":"序列化格式选择","id":"序列化格式选择"},{"level":3,"text":"主流格式对比","id":"主流格式对比"},{"level":3,"text":"Avro Schema 示例","id":"avro-schema-示例"},{"level":3,"text":"Protobuf Schema 示例","id":"protobuf-schema-示例"},{"level":2,"text":"Schema Registry（Schema 注册中心）","id":"schema-registry-schema-注册中心"},{"level":2,"text":"消费者驱动契约测试（CDCT）","id":"消费者驱动契约测试-cdct"},{"level":3,"text":"Pact 框架示例","id":"pact-框架示例"},{"level":3,"text":"契约测试的价值","id":"契约测试的价值"},{"level":2,"text":"版本策略：何时创建新版本","id":"版本策略-何时创建新版本"},{"level":2,"text":"兄弟文档参考","id":"兄弟文档参考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"事件类型设计与 CloudEvents 规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-microservices/foundations/event-types-and-cloudevents"},"next":{"title":"最终一致性保障机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-microservices/foundations/eventual-consistency"}}